<p>Hi <%= @first_name %>!</p>

<p>We're super excited to invite you to complete your onboarding materials for Hack Club's <%= @event_name %>. We can't wait to welcome you to <%= @location %> for an amazing hackathon.</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button "Complete your onboarding using Attend", @onboarding_url %>
</p>

<p><strong>What does this include?</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>You'll be asked to sign in with Hack Club Account - if you don't have one, it'll run you through the process automatically.</li>
  <li>You'll add information like your name, birthday, and your contact info as well as your medical information.</li>
  <li>You'll let us know how you're getting to <%= @location %> - plane, bus, car etc.</li>
  <li>You'll let us know your parent/guardian's email & contact details in case of emergency.</li>
</ul>

<p>If you have any questions about this process, don't hesitate to email us at <%= mail_to @support_email %>, or just hit reply to this email!</p>

<p>We can't wait to see you at <%= @event_name %>!</p>
